{%- comment -%}
  illustration — the FYE line drawings.

  Usage:  {% render 'illustration', name: 'diamond' %}

  Bespoke artwork drawn for the brand: 0.75px stroke, Eternal Teal, each
  with its own viewBox and proportions. Used by the `shipping` section
  ("why choose us") on the ring pages.

  NOT the same thing as snippets/icon.liquid. Those are UI icons on a fixed
  24x24 grid at 1.3px in currentColor; these are decorative illustrations
  at their own scale. Do not merge the two.

  Generated by docs/tools/extract-illustrations.mjs from the old theme's
  template JSON, where all eight were pasted into block settings and
  duplicated across three pages. Edit them HERE now.

  Decorative, so the SVG carries aria-hidden from the calling section.
{%- endcomment -%}
